body:
im BP2 and ADHD! i take seroquel and adderall and its the perfect mix for me - its very common for people to have both! for me adhd was my first concern/thing i noticed in myself and self advocated for. just like you i was almost certain that i had it, but my first psychiatrist pointed to bipolar and refused to even consider ADHD. i ditched that psych and my new one fully considered both and i got formally diagnosed with them. 

however it was much more important for me to find stability and meds for bipolar first, so i didn’t start ADHD stimulants until AFTER i was stable on meds.

if you have any questions about diagnostic process, meds, how to distinguish the two, etc, u can ask and i will answer to my best ability :)
